{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"houfei-e-o005b","title":"卞氏止曹操左右听凶问归散","accounts":[{"id":"houfei-e-o005b-account","label":"《后妃传》正文","text":"董卓乱后曹操东出，袁术传曹操凶问，卞氏劝左右勿遽归，曹操后闻而善之。","evidence":["houfei-e-o005b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0388","role":"劝留","evidence":["houfei-e-o005b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0057","role":"传凶问","evidence":["houfei-e-o005b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"董卓为乱时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["houfei-e-o005b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"houfei-e-o005b-q","source_order":[5,22,"O005b"],"order":1337}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0057","name":"袁术","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0388","name":"卞夫人","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-e-o005b-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-05a1b9e74257021c7f9d","layer":"original","quote":"及董卓为乱，太祖微服东出避难〖4〗。袁术传太祖凶问〖5〗，时太祖左右至洛者，皆欲归。后止之曰：“曹君吉凶未可知！今日还家，明日若在，何面目复相见也？正使祸至〖6〗，共死何苦〖7〗？”遂从后言。太祖闻而善之。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":53,"end":156}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
